            <ArticleTitle>An extensive suprarenal inferior vena cava thrombosis successfully treated with catheter-directed thrombolysis in a postpartum 14-year-old girl.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>227-230</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1024/0301-1526/a000605</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report a case of extensive early postpartum acute suprarenal inferior vena cava thrombosis in a 14-year-old girl. Management included catheter-directed-thrombolysis, aiming to save renal function and prevent fatal pulmonary embolism. Treatment decisions were mostly based on adult guidelines, as guidelines for the paediatric population are not yet available.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
